<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring wheat bids drop.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring wheat bids drop.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash bids for dark northern spring wheat were lower again at most locations in reaction to lower prices on major U.S. wheat futures markets, dealers said.</p>
<p>A few dealers reported buying small quantities of wheat Wednesday, but in most areas the lower cash prices discouraged farmer selling.</p>
<p>Wheat futures prices dropped partly in reaction to news that Canada was shipping a small amount of wheat by rail to Portland.  </p>
